       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-THZ-HYDRAT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-THZ-HYDRAT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PERMITTIVITY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOMOGRAPHY-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HETERODYNE-STABLE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THZ-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THZ-SEAL-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-THZ-HYDRAT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PTH-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PTH-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PERMIT-AND-TOMO.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-HETERO-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTH-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PERMIT-AND-TOMO.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PERMITTIVITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOMOGRAPHY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-HETERO-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HETERODYNE-STABLE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THZ-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTH-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PERMITTIVITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TOMOGRAPHY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HETERODYNE-STABLE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-THZ-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-THZ-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PTH-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PTH-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PTH-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PTH-CODE.
